---
import SquarespaceFooter from '../components/SquarespaceFooter.astro';
import SquarespaceHeader from '../components/SquarespaceHeader.astro';
import type { ShellConfig } from '../config/shell';
import { shellConfig } from '../config/shell';
import SquarespaceShellLayout from '../layouts/SquarespaceShellLayout.astro';

const { config = shellConfig }: { config?: ShellConfig } = Astro.props;
---
<SquarespaceShellLayout config={config}>
  <div id="siteWrapper" class="clearfix site-wrapper">
    <SquarespaceHeader config={config} />

    <main id="page" class="ht-main" tabindex="-1">

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 2 — BACKGROUND / BIOGRAPHY
           ====================================================== -->
      <section class="ht-about-bio">
        <div class="ht-about-bio__layout">
          <article class="ht-about-bio__prose">
            <h1 class="ht-about-bio__h2">Background</h1>
            <p class="ht-about-bio__p">
              My name is Majid Hasan, and I’m a graduate of the KU School of Law
              and a professional tutor. I have years of experience tutoring, a
              deep understanding of these exams, and people use me because I get
              students results.
            </p>
            <p class="ht-about-bio__p">
              I started out teaching standardized tests in 2006 at Kaplan Test
              Prep. At first I taught the LSAT, the Law School Admissions Test,
              and then quickly moved on to the ACT and SAT. After finishing
              undergrad at KU, I moved back to Kansas City, my hometown, and
              started working at the Kauffman Foundation. Soon after, I was also
              working at Get Smarter Prep, a test prep company here in Overland
              Park. During my second year of law school, I began tutoring on my
              own. All in all, I have nearly 8 years of experience teaching
              classrooms and tutoring one-on-one.
            </p>
            <p class="ht-about-bio__p ht-about-bio__p--last">
              Since tutoring on my own, I've built up a significant number of
              clients purely through word of mouth. I like to think this is
              because I leave my students (and their parents of course!) highly
              satisfied with my services. Chances are if your child attends
              school in the Overland Park/Kansas City area, they know classmates
              who've used my services.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="ht-about-bio__prose ht-about-bio__prose--philosophy">
            <h2 class="ht-about-bio__h2">Teaching Philosophy</h2>
            <p class="ht-about-bio__p">
              In my opinion, the ACT and SAT should be taught differently than
              academic subjects in school are taught. These tests are highly
              repetitive and highly coachable. Once in a Physics class I took,
              we students had long since figured out that the professor's
              homework was exactly the same semester after semester; only the
              individual numbers in the questions were different. This meant
              that every question was done the same way and all we had to do was
              substitute the different numbers in. These tests are the same way.
              There are only so many different types of questions. The way to
              improve is to simply learn the types of questions, how to recognize
              them, and learn the simple steps to arrive at the right answer. I
              teach students how to recognize the different types of questions
              and the steps to answer them. The types of questions that appear on
              the tests are the same from test to test. Anyone, with some
              coaching and practice, can improve their scores using this method.
            </p>
            <p class="ht-about-bio__p ht-about-bio__p--last">
              I employ a very laid back, no pressure attitude towards both my
              teaching and my teaching business. I assign a good amount of work,
              but students generally like working with me because I create a very
              easy going environment in which students are free to make mistakes.
              I've always been good at explaining things in a way everyone can
              understand. I'm the same way with my business approach to teaching.
              If you are interested in tutoring for your son or daughter, please
              feel free to call or email me. I'll answer whatever questions you
              have about my services, will give you solid and honest advice about
              how you should proceed, supply you with free practice exams, and
              never pressure you in any way. Please give me a shout anytime.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 4 — CTA STRIP
           ====================================================== -->
      <section class="ht-cta-strip">
        <div class="ht-cta-strip__inner">
          <h2 class="ht-cta-strip__h2">Let's talk — no sales pitch, ever.</h2>
          <p class="ht-cta-strip__body">
            Call or email me anytime. I'm happy to answer questions, talk
            through your situation, and give you a free practice test to
            get a baseline score.
          </p>
          <div class="ht-cta-strip__btns">
            <a href="/contact" class="ht-btn ht-btn--white">Get in touch</a>
            <a href="tel:9132100611" class="ht-btn ht-btn--ghost">913.210.0611</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <SquarespaceFooter config={config} />
  </div>

  <script is:inline defer="true" src={config.siteBundle} type="text/javascript"></script>
  <div id="yui3-css-stamp" style="position: absolute !important; visibility: hidden !important"></div>
</SquarespaceShellLayout>

<style>
  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Reset Squarespace container constraints on main
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  :global(#page.ht-main) {
    max-width: none !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Shared utilities
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }

  .ht-eyebrow--crimson {
    color: var(--color-accent-crimson);
  }

  .ht-eyebrow--gold {
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
  }

  .ht-gold-rule {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ht-gold-rule--wide {
    width: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 1 — HERO
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-about-hero {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding-top: clamp(12rem, 16vw, 15rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    padding-left: var(--space-section-h);
    padding-right: var(--space-section-h);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ht-about-hero__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-about-hero__h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ht-about-hero__em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ht-about-hero__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 2 — BIOGRAPHY
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-about-bio {
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) var(--space-section-h);
  }

  .ht-about-bio__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0;
    align-items: flex-start;
    max-width: var(--content-full);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* LEFT: credentials sidebar */
  .ht-about-bio__sidebar {
    flex: 0 0 220px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .ht-credential__label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .ht-credential__value {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* RIGHT: bio prose */
  .ht-about-bio__prose {
    min-width: 0;
    padding-right: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .ht-about-bio__prose--philosophy {
    padding-right: 0;
    padding-left: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .ht-about-bio__prose .ht-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .ht-about-bio__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .ht-about-bio__p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .ht-about-bio__p--last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 3 — TEACHING PHILOSOPHY
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-about-philosophy {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) var(--space-section-h);
  }

  .ht-about-philosophy__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-about-philosophy__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .ht-about-philosophy__p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .ht-about-philosophy__p--last {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 4 — CTA STRIP
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-cta-strip {
    background: var(--color-bg-dark);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) var(--space-section-h);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Buttons
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background var(--transition-fast), color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), opacity var(--transition-fast);
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ht-btn--white {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-bg-dark);
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  }

  .ht-btn--white:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ht-btn--ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
  }

  .ht-btn--ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Responsive
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ht-about-bio__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ht-about-bio__prose {
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .ht-about-bio__prose--philosophy {
      margin-top: var(--space-10);
      padding-top: var(--space-10);
      padding-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
